-- **World Monitor Agent Plugin metadata:** public metadata at https://www.worldmonitor.app/plugin.json for the Agent Plugins 1.0.0 repository package. Install from https://github.com/koala73/worldmonitor (root `plugin.json`, `mcp.json`, and `skills/*/SKILL.md` live in the repository, not as sibling HTTP files)
